  "core": "Transformation ends what has run its course and opens what was blocked. In Breakthrough, it works on the structures that have stopped holding — the walls that protected now confine. When the ending stays hidden, the old form crumbles while its collapse goes unwitnessed, and what breaks free has no solid ground to land on. The wreckage spreads without being named.",
